
    actor User
    participant Library
    participant Book
    participant Loan

    User->>Library: create_loan(book, user, start_date, end_date)
    Library->>Book: Check availability
    Book-->>Library: available = True
    Library->>Loan: Create Loan(book, user, dates)
    Loan->>Book: mark_as_unavailable()
    Book-->>Loan: available = False
    Loan-->>Library: Return loan
    Library-->>User: Loan created

    Note over User,Book: Book is now unavailable

    User->>Loan: close_loan()
    Loan->>Book: mark_as_available()
    Book-->>Loan: available = True
    Loan->>Loan: closed = True
    Loan-->>User: Loan closed

    Note over User,Book: Book is available again

